  },
  {
    "id": "jose_ex1_note",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "jose_ex1_tab",
    "name": "Setup: paste a secret into the key configuration first",
    "info": "1. Generate a random secret: `openssl rand -base64 32`\n2. Open the *demo HS256 secret* configuration (menu > Configuration nodes, or double-click the sign node and edit its key) and paste the secret into **Secret**. Encoding stays `base64`.\n3. Deploy, then click the inject button.\n\nExpected debug output: the compact token (three dot-separated parts), then the verified claims `{ sub: \"alice\", role: \"admin\", iat, exp }` with `exp` one hour after `iat`.\n\nTampering with the token or waiting past `exp` sends the message to the *rejected* output with `msg.error.code` set, because *On rejection* is set to the second output.",
    "x": 250,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "jose_ex1_inject",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "jose_ex1_tab",
    "name": "claims",
    "props": [{ "p": "payload" }],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": 0.1,
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "{\"sub\":\"alice\",\"role\":\"admin\"}",
    "payloadType": "json",
    "x": 130,
    "y": 120,
    "wires": [["jose_ex1_sign"]]
  },
  {
    "id": "jose_ex1_sign",
    "type": "jose-sign",
    "z": "jose_ex1_tab",
    "name": "",
    "key": "jose_ex1_key",
    "claims": "payload",
    "claimsType": "msg",
    "typ": "JWT",
    "expiryMode": "ttl",
    "ttlSeconds": 3600,
    "expiresAt": "",
    "issuedAt": true,
    "notBeforeMode": "preserve",
    "notBeforeSeconds": 0,
    "notBeforeAt": "",
    "tokenTo": "payload",
    "tokenToType": "msg",
    "x": 300,
    "y": 120,
    "wires": [["jose_ex1_token", "jose_ex1_verify"]]
  },
